{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1528050-encyclopedia-of-darkness-just-for-fun","id":1528050,"title":"Encyclopedia of Darkness [Just For Fun]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-01-05T13:19:00-08:00","id":1528050,"title":"Encyclopedia of Darkness [Just For Fun]","content":"So for a while I have felt the itch to once again come and try to organize the mess which is called the &quot;CofDverse&quot; into neat boxes (impossible task, yes I know), and I thought to myself &quot;well, let's just get on with it&quot;. And so, I donned once again the alias of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology\">Dr Fredrickstein</a>, and I started to compiling the mountains of data which is called the CofD's canon, while adding some headcanons, homebrew material and adaptations made for homebrew made by others. Very quickly I came to realize that this task might be larger than I initially conceived, especially considering my relatively stressed schedule, and so I decided to at the very least finish the major parts of the canon (mostly protagonist splats alongside what I felt was necessary to give them context), as well as a few homebrew parts which I felt appropriate to include already at this stage and then publish it here even though it is still very much WIP. Also, playing into the theme of the in-story justification for this project, I decided to authorize comments to the documents- think about it as part of the game, as I will only answer comments there IC :P<br /> <br /> Anyway, without further adieu, I present to you Dr Fredrickstein's latest work- the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oRJTOHPJez2rOAfkWQVBDVxu2xjnLDPqRhHXOODAPDQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Encyclopedia of Darkness</a>. Let me know what you think!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-21T12:12:52-08:00","id":1529100,"title":"","content":"So it took a while, but I finally finished covering V:tR's books. I might end up removing certain entries depending on how I'll feel later, as I don't try to compile any critter in the CofDverse, only those which I want to relate to a greater metaphysical meaning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https: